    guideTitle:'Product Guide', guideIntro:'Below are the features Jiheng actually provides today. This page stays in sync with the real system.', guideAccountsTitle:'Account Management', guideAccountsDesc:'Manage multiple real-world money record accounts (Cash, Bank, TNG, GrabPay, Boost, MAE, ShopeePay, custom).', guideTxTitle:'Transaction Records', guideTxDesc:'Record income and expenses: amount, date, time, category, account, method, note. Notes support any length and are stored and displayed fully.', guideTransferTitle:'Transfer Records', guideTransferDesc:'Record real-world transfers from Account A to Account B. Jiheng only records; it does not move your money.', guideRecordsTitle:'Records', guideRecordsDesc:'A dedicated section for real-world money events that are not Income or Expense. Includes Debt Records and Money Given.', guideDebtsTitle:'Debt Records', guideDebtsDesc:'Record what you owe (I Owe) and what others owe you (Owed to Me). Choose account-linked or record-only. Supports multiple repayments and status tracking. Records only, no actual payments.', guideMoneyGivenTitle:'Money Given', guideMoneyGivenDesc:'Record money already given in the real world. Choose source account, purpose, method and nature (Gift / Loan / Other). Choosing Loan also creates an "Owed to Me" debt without double-deducting.', guideGoalTitle:'Savings Goals', guideGoalDesc:'Create savings goals and allocate available balance. Allocation is a record-level split; Jiheng does not actually lock funds.', guideAssetTitle:'Asset Records', guideAssetDesc:'Record real assets (phone, laptop, camera) and calculate theoretical use value over expected lifetime.', guideStatsTitle:'Statistics', guideStatsDesc:'Income, expense, net savings, category breakdown and monthly trend based on your real records. Empty state when no data.', guideSearchTitle:'Search & Filter', guideSearchDesc:'Supports Chinese, English, Unicode, Emoji, partial matching. Combines with type / date / account / category filters.', guideTimeTitle:'Time & Edit History', guideTimeDesc:'Each record stores event time (second-level), created time, last updated time and full edit history for traceability. Each edit appends a new entry, never overwrites.', guideAchTitle:'Achievements', guideAchDesc:'Unlock achievements based on real usage. Each shows name, description, how-to-unlock, progress and status.', guideLockTitle:'App Lock', guideLockDesc:'Protect the app with a 6-digit PIN or custom password. Password is hashed, never stored as plain text. Biometrics reserved for future.', guideDataTitle:'Backup & Restore', guideDataDesc:'Export JSON, export CSV, import and restore. Import validates file format and data version; failure does not overwrite existing data.', guideLangTitle:'Language', guideLangDesc:'Supports Simplified Chinese, English, Bahasa Melayu. System UI follows the language, but user-defined names and notes are never translated.', guidePrivacyTitle:'Hide Amounts', guidePrivacyDesc:'When enabled, amounts in Home, Accounts, Records, Goals, Assets and Stats show as ••••••.', guideLocalTitle:'Local-first', guideLocalDesc:'Current version is Local-first. Data is stored in this browser without needing network. Future cloud sync is reserved as an extension.',
